{
  "about": "Shifted keys stay in a text box (issue #301): with hotbar slot 1 on Shift+F1 (userkeys/shift-f1.lua) and a Red Potion in it, Shift+F1 with the chat line open (as it is outside battle mode) types into it and uses nothing.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "env": {"RUSTNAROK_CLIENT_USERKEYS": "{repo}/.claude/skills/rustnarok-dev/userkeys/shift-f1.lua"},
